<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξανα-δύομαι</span></b> , aor. 2
		
			Act.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξανέδυν,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rise out of, emerge from,</i>
			as a diver from the water, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλός,
				κύματος ἐξαναδύς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.405
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.438
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλύος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					20.240c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ ὕδατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					133
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενέσεως ἐ.</span>”
				<i>arise from, emerge from,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					525b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>escape from,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαναδύεσθαι φανερᾶς μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sert.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀΐδεω μέγα δῶμ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1124
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχον</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.12.4
			</span></i>.</div>
